  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116526",
      "title": "Introducing Deferrable Views",
      "lectureOrder": 307,
      "videoOrder": 292,
      "sourceHash": "1fc0cd21f3c96b52fa41dab91529ca7a59bd243ba7511c18672d7e91d97db391",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 3.63,
          "en": "So route-based lazy loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.63,
          "end": 6.96,
          "en": "is one important lazy loading mechanism",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.96,
          "end": 9.6,
          "en": "or feature offered by Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.6,
          "end": 12.96,
          "en": "and it is an approach you will likely use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.96,
          "end": 15.663,
          "en": "in a lot of Angular applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 18.54,
          "en": "But modern Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.54,
          "end": 23.34,
          "en": "so Angular projects using version 17 or higher",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.34,
          "end": 27.06,
          "en": "also offer you another way of lazy loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.06,
          "end": 28.92,
          "en": "parts of your application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 32.13,
          "en": "You can use deferrable views there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.13,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "and that's what we'll explore next",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 39.51,
          "en": "at the example of a brand new dummy demo application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.51,
          "end": 42.06,
          "en": "which you find attached as always.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.06,
          "end": 44.52,
          "en": "And this is a very simple application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.52,
          "end": 47.97,
          "en": "that in the end only consists of three Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.97,
          "end": 51.45,
          "en": "And if you install all the dependencies here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.45,
          "end": 54.66,
          "en": "and you then start that development server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.66,
          "end": 57.54,
          "en": "and you visit local host 4,200,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.54,
          "end": 61.47,
          "en": "you'll see this basic site on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 65.1,
          "en": "Now, here on this site, I have some sections",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 66.87,
          "en": "with some dummy text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.87,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "and then at the very bottom I have this offer area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "where I got this progress bar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 75.03,
          "en": "which is kind of counting down.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.03,
          "end": 79.26,
          "en": "And after this time here expired,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.26,
          "end": 84.26,
          "en": "this offer will actually become invalid as you will see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.14,
          "end": 87.3,
          "en": "Though, it's also worth noting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.3,
          "end": 91.92,
          "en": "that clicking View Offer won't do anything here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.92,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "because this is just a dummy demo page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 96.96000000000001,
          "en": "which I wanna use to introduce you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.96000000000001,
          "end": 100.02000000000001,
          "en": "to this deferrable views feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.02000000000001,
          "end": 103.25999999999999,
          "en": "And for that, let's say that it, for example, makes no sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.25999999999999,
          "end": 107.16,
          "en": "to show this offer here to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.16,
          "end": 109.92,
          "en": "if the user just loaded this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.92,
          "end": 113.22,
          "en": "Since we got a counter there, we might wanna wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.22,
          "end": 115.68,
          "en": "until the user scrolled down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.68,
          "end": 119.25,
          "en": "and is actually able to see that offer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.25,
          "end": 122.19,
          "en": "Starting the timer before the user even gets there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.19,
          "end": 123.87,
          "en": "doesn't sound fair.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.87,
          "end": 126.18,
          "en": "In addition, the code for this timer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.18,
          "end": 128.7,
          "en": "is definitely not super complex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.7,
          "end": 133.41,
          "en": "but I am using a couple of RXJS operators here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.41,
          "end": 137.1,
          "en": "to set up this timer with help of RxJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.1,
          "end": 139.71,
          "en": "Of course, you could do it without RxJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.71,
          "end": 142.05,
          "en": "but I deliberately did it like this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.05,
          "end": 146.55,
          "en": "so that we are actually importing some code from RxJS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.55,
          "end": 149.22,
          "en": "which we don't really need to load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.22,
          "end": 153.03,
          "en": "initially when the page just starts up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.03,
          "end": 156.09,
          "en": "because again, we actually don't even want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.09,
          "end": 159.03,
          "en": "to start the timer at that point.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.03,
          "end": 162.9,
          "en": "So loading this component and all the related code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.9,
          "end": 166.44,
          "en": "just when the website here becomes visible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.44,
          "end": 168.63,
          "en": "doesn't make too much sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.63,
          "end": 171.09,
          "en": "And that would be a perfect scenario",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.09,
          "end": 174.69299999999998,
          "en": "for lazy loading this part of the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.4,
          "end": 181.4,
          "en": "So for lazy loading this app offer preview component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.51,
          "end": 185.01,
          "en": "and that's something we can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.01,
          "end": 187.653,
          "en": "with help of this deferrable views feature.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
